                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="realisations" class="novax-reveal bg-white px-6 py-24 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
        <div class="mb-14 flex flex-col justify-between gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-end">
          <div>
            <p class="mb-4 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-indigo-500">/04 — Réalisations</p>
            <h2 class="max-w-2xl text-4xl font-black leading-tight tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-5xl">
              Des idées transformées
              <span class="text-indigo-500">en solutions.</span>
            </h2>
          </div>

          <p class="max-w-md text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
            Découvrez quelques projets et expérimentations réalisés par NOVAX.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
          <article class="group overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f3f6fc] novax-reveal">
            <div class="relative flex h-64 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-indigo-100">
              <div class="absolute h-40 w-40 rounded-full border-[18px] border-indigo-300"></div>
              <div class="relative z-10 flex h-24 w-24 rotate-45 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-slate-950 shadow-xl">
                <span class="-rotate-45 text-2xl font-black text-lime-300">P</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="p-7">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-indigo-500">Portfolio</span>
              <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-black text-slate-950">Mon portfolio</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Portfolio personnel présentant mes compétences, parcours et premières réalisations.</p>
              <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-slate-600">
                <span class="rounded-full bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5">Web</span>
                <span class="rounded-full bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5">Portfolio</span>
              </div>
              <a href={contact.portfolioUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-bold text-slate-950 transition group-hover:text-indigo-500">
                Voir le projet →
              </a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="group overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f3f6fc] novax-reveal">
            <div class="relative flex h-64 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-lime-200">
              <div class="absolute -right-10 -top-10 h-48 w-48 rounded-full border-[20px] border-lime-100"></div>
